 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Enablement of SAP Excise Tax Management (4LO)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1c9da49d0a63421fb77c7ecf6b32c2b2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c9da49d0a63421fb77c7ecf6b32c2b2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The integration scenario described here deals with the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> APIs for integration with the SAP Excise Tax Management. The APIs are in the areas of Master Data (business partners, materials, organizational data), materials Management (Material Documents), Logistics Execution (Delivery for EMCS (Excise Movement and Control System)), Sales (pricing in Sales Order and Billing), Financials (posting of excise taxes to Accounting).</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Country- and customer-specific details aren't covered and must be implemented on an individual basis to meet both legal and customer requirements.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c9da49d0a63421fb77c7ecf6b32c2b2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Replicate organizational data – storage locations and plants</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Replicate master data – material master and business partners</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Replicate material documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Replicate financial documents for tax accruals (optional)</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c9da49d0a63421fb77c7ecf6b32c2b2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable SAP Excise Tax Management</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>启用 SAP Excise Tax Management (4LO)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1c9da49d0a63421fb77c7ecf6b32c2b2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c9da49d0a63421fb77c7ecf6b32c2b2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此处描述的集成场景处理用于与 SAP Excise Tax Management 集成的 SAP <span class=\"ph pname\">S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> API。API 位于主数据（业务伙伴、物料、组织数据）、物料管理（物料凭证）、物流执行（EMCS 交货（消费税移动和控制系统））、销售（销售订单和开票中的定价）、财务（将消费税过账到会计核算）区域中。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">不涵盖国家/地区和客户特定的详细信息，必须单独实施这些详细信息以满足法律和客户要求。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c9da49d0a63421fb77c7ecf6b32c2b2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">复制组织数据 - 存储地点和工厂</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">复制主数据 - 物料主数据和业务伙伴</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">复制物料凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">复制税收应计的财务凭证（可选）</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1c9da49d0a63421fb77c7ecf6b32c2b2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">启用 SAP Excise Tax Management</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
